return {h=4,w=19,cr=190,hc=20,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"water2"},st={50,48,43,46,41,60},ab={{12,0},{107,0},{93,1}},genus={en="Whiskers Pokémon",es="Pokémon Bigotudo",pt="Pokémon Bigode"},flavor={en={[7]="BARBOACH’s sensitive whiskers serve as a superb radar system. This Pokémon hides in mud, leaving only its two whiskers exposed while it waits for prey to come along.",[8]="BARBOACH’s body is covered with a slimy film. If a foe grabs it, this Pokémon just slips out of the enemy’s grip. This Pokémon grows weak if the slimy coating dries up.",[9]="Its body is covered with a slimy film. The film acts as a barrier to prevent germs in muddy water from entering the BARBOACH’s body.",[10]="It probes muddy riverbeds with its two long whiskers. A slimy film protects its body.",[11]="It probes muddy riverbeds with its two long whiskers. A slimy film protects its body.",[12]="It coats its entire body with a slimy fluid so it can squirm and slip away if grabbed.",[13]="Its whiskers make a superb radar. They are used to locate prey, even in the murkiest of water.",[14]="Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.",[15]="BARBOACH uses its whiskers to taste things just as a person uses his or her tongue to taste things.",[16]="BARBOACH uses its whiskers to taste things just as a person uses his or her tongue to taste things.",[17]="Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.",[18]="Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.",[21]="Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.",[22]="Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.",[23]="It coats its entire body with a slimy fluid so it can squirm and slip away if grabbed.",[24]="Its whiskers make a superb radar. They are used to locate prey, even in the murkiest of water.",[25]="Barboach’s sensitive whiskers serve as a superb radar system. This Pokémon hides in mud, leaving only its two whiskers exposed while it waits for prey to come along.",[26]="Barboach’s body is covered with a slimy film. If a foe grabs it, this Pokémon just slips out of the enemy’s grip. This Pokémon grows weak if the slimy coating dries up.",[27]="Its two whiskers provide a sensitive radar. Even in muddy waters, it can detect its prey’s location.",[28]="Its slippery body is hard to grasp, so much so that there are festivals where people compete to see how many they can catch barehanded.",[29]="Its entire body is gooey. When pecked at by bird Pokémon, it slips and slides its way to freedom.",[30]="Its whiskers are filled with nerves. They can sense smells and flavors just as a person’s nose or tongue would.",[33]="Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.",[34]="It probes muddy riverbeds with its two long whiskers. A slimy film protects its body.",[39]="Makes its home in swamps with murky water. The poor visibility hides this Pokémon from predators, and the slime on its body makes grasping it difficult."},es={[23]="Recubre su cuerpo de una película viscosa que le permite escapar si alguien lo agarra.",[24]="Sus bigotes le sirven de radar para localizar a sus presas, incluso en las aguas más turbias.",[25]="Barboach tiene unos bigotes sensibles que le sirven de infalible radar. Este Pokémon se sumerge en lodo y solo deja los bigotes por fuera de la superficie, al acecho, mientras espera a que llegue su presa.",[26]="Barboach está completamente recubierto por una película viscosa. Si lo atrapan, puede escurrirse fácilmente. Si se le seca la capa viscosa, este Pokémon se debilitará.",[27]="Sus bigotes son muy sensibles y le sirven de radar. Puede detectar la posición de su presa incluso en el agua turbia de los lodazales.",[28]="Su cuerpo es tan escurridizo que incluso hay competiciones para ver cuántas veces puede ser agarrado con las manos desnudas.",[29]="Su cuerpo viscoso y resbaladizo le permite escapar indemne de las garras de los Pokémon pájaro que intentan atraparlo.",[30]="Sus bigotes contienen terminaciones nerviosas. Eso les permite captar olores y sabores, como si fueran la nariz o la lengua de un ser humano.",[33]="Su escurridizo cuerpo es difícil de agarrar. En cierta región se dice que ha nacido de barro endurecido.",[34]="Examina los lechos lodosos de los ríos con los largos bigotes que tiene. Está protegido por una capa viscosa."},pt="Vive em pântanos de água turva. A baixa visibilidade esconde este Pokémon dos predadores, e o muco do corpo dificulta agarrá-lo."},evo={{s=339},{s=340,from=339,c={{t="level-up",lv=30}}}},moves={[5]={1,189,6,300,6,346,11,55,16,222,21,133,26,156,26,173,31,89,36,248,41,90},[6]={1,189,6,300,6,346,11,55,16,222,21,133,26,156,26,173,31,89,36,248,41,90},[7]={1,189,6,300,6,346,11,55,16,222,21,133,26,156,26,173,31,89,36,248,41,90},[8]={1,189,6,300,6,346,10,55,14,426,18,133,22,352,26,222,31,156,31,173,35,401,39,89,43,248,47,90},[9]={1,189,6,300,6,346,10,55,14,426,18,133,22,352,26,222,31,156,31,173,35,401,39,89,43,248,47,90},[10]={1,189,6,300,6,346,10,55,14,426,18,133,22,352,26,222,31,156,31,173,35,401,39,89,43,248,47,90},[11]={1,189,6,300,6,346,10,55,14,426,18,133,22,352,26,222,31,156,31,173,35,401,39,89,43,248,47,90},[12]={1,189,6,300,6,346,11,55,16,222,21,133,26,156,26,173,31,89,36,248,41,90},[13]={1,189,6,300,6,346,11,55,16,222,21,133,26,156,26,173,31,89,36,248,41,90},[14]={1,189,6,300,6,346,10,55,14,426,18,133,22,352,26,222,31,156,31,173,35,401,39,89,43,248,47,90},[15]={1,189,6,300,6,346,10,55,14,426,18,133,22,352,26,222,31,156,31,173,35,401,39,89,43,248,47,90},[16]={1,189,6,300,6,346,9,55,13,426,15,133,17,352,20,222,25,156,25,173,28,401,32,89,35,330,39,248,44,90},[17]={1,189,6,300,6,346,9,55,13,426,15,133,17,352,20,222,25,156,25,173,28,401,32,89,35,330,39,248,44,90},[18]={1,189,6,300,6,346,9,55,13,426,15,133,17,352,20,222,25,156,25,173,28,401